{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to physical birth, there is also a mental one. Sometimes, to carefreely play games, you need to go out into the world and solve your problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain-Hatching is a game about the birth of a personality, filled with the best game mechanics: exploring, stat leveling, and deck-building. Meet interesting characters and a well-crafted world, and play the game as if it is a game. Pain-Hatching doesn't hide this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play games within the game! N-times more games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore locations, fight, farm loot, level up, find secrets, and interact with NPCs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use phone features: photos, transferring to photos, solving puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card battling with RPG mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear a funny hat, not an efficient one!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850340/extras/1b4e37dac87e3ca5382975f556db7de0.webp?t=1770545535\" width=467 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850340/extras/9e2ae6728ddc303a686b71f7e3f6d043.poster.avif?t=1770545535\" width=640 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850340/extras/9e2ae6728ddc303a686b71f7e3f6d043.webm?t=1770545535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850340/extras/9e2ae6728ddc303a686b71f7e3f6d043.mp4?t=1770545535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s